<ac:layout-section ac:type="two_right_sidebar">
<ac:layout-cell>
<h2>Where configuration lives</h2>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Source</th><th>Path or location</th><th>Managed by</th><th>Precedence</th></tr>
<tr><td>Defaults</td><td><em>[Built into the binary]</em></td><td>Vendor</td><td>Lowest</td></tr>
<tr><td>Config file</td><td><em>[/etc/example/example.yaml]</em></td><td><em>[Ansible role example]</em></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Environment variables</td><td><em>[Systemd unit drop-in]</em></td><td><em>[Ansible role example]</em></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td>Command-line flags</td><td><em>[Systemd ExecStart]</em></td><td><em>[Ansible role example]</em></td><td>Highest</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="warning">
<ac:rich-text-body>
<p>Edit configuration in <em>[the source of truth]</em>, not on the host. Hand edits are overwritten on the next run.</p>
</ac:rich-text-body>
</ac:structured-macro>
<h2>Options</h2>
<h3><em>[Section: server]</em></h3>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Option</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th><th>Restart</th></tr>
<tr><td><em>[server.port]</em></td><td>integer</td><td><em>[8080]</em></td><td><em>[TCP port to listen on]</em></td><td>Yes</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>[server.tls.enabled]</em></td><td>boolean</td><td><em>[false]</em></td><td><em>[Serve HTTPS; requires cert and key]</em></td><td>Yes</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>[server.timeout]</em></td><td>duration</td><td><em>[30s]</em></td><td><em>[Request timeout]</em></td><td>No</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3><em>[Section: database]</em></h3>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Option</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th><th>Restart</th></tr>
<tr><td><em>[database.url]</em></td><td>string</td><td>none</td><td><em>[JDBC or DSN connection string. Required.]</em></td><td>Yes</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>[database.pool.max]</em></td><td>integer</td><td><em>[20]</em></td><td><em>[Maximum open connections]</em></td><td>No</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2>Environment variables</h2>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Variable</th><th>Overrides</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
<tr><td><em>[EXAMPLE_DB_URL]</em></td><td><em>[database.url]</em></td><td><em>[Keeps the secret out of the file]</em></td></tr>
<tr><td><em>[EXAMPLE_LOG_LEVEL]</em></td><td><em>[logging.level]</em></td><td></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2>Secrets</h2>
<p><em>[Which values are secrets, where they are stored, how they are injected, and the rotation schedule.]</em></p>
<h2>Example configuration</h2>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">yaml</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Production</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[server:
  port: 8443
  tls:
    enabled: true
    cert: /etc/example/tls/server.crt
    key: /etc/example/tls/server.key
database:
  url: ${EXAMPLE_DB_URL}
  pool:
    max: 40]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<h2>Validation and reload</h2>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">bash</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[example --config /etc/example/example.yaml --validate
sudo systemctl reload example.service]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<h2>Deprecated options</h2>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Option</th><th>Deprecated in</th><th>Removed in</th><th>Replacement</th></tr>
<tr><td><em>[server.ssl]</em></td><td><em>[2.0]</em></td><td><em>[3.0]</em></td><td><em>[server.tls.enabled]</em></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
